/* Japanese catalog. Keys mirror en.lproj exactly. Status glyphs (○ ● ◐ ✕)
   are unchanged; only the word is translated. Technical terms the user
   needs verbatim (claude, Claude Code, claude auth login, ターミナル,
   /Applications, config.json, .bak, worktree) and the product name
   "Claude RC Manager" stay untranslated. Apple's Japanese style: no ASCII
   spaces around embedded Latin terms, CJK punctuation (、。？). */

